      "en": "A father of the fatherless, and a defender of the widows, is God in his holy habitation.",
      "ko": "그 거룩한 처소에 계신 하나님은 고아의 아버지시며 과부의 재판장이시라",
      "source_text_hash": "7ecac04e2de69fcb3faaba65437bad0a0992bd74848ea2cab421ae889a1fb058",
      "translation_text_hash": "5b982d64efa11cf6f0d01ba7d191ca0361555acaaef9959b984938fe6bfe1337",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
