      "en": "God, when you went out before your people, when you marched through the wilderness... Selah.",
      "ko": "하나님이여 주의 백성 앞에서 앞서 나가사 광야에 행진하셨을 때에(셀라)",
      "source_text_hash": "a70667b3bc27e11aa55aaf0e0ff92303398079e35075ee8e600b6b0ac79aabe3",
      "translation_text_hash": "30c9973c90d3c77bac81589410a317995c5aee02014df00a71f96f1c27d21bc8",
